    <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to main content</a>

    <header class="hero">
      <span class="eyebrow">FAQ</span>
      <h1>Everything you want to know about cats</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        A compact guide to common cat questions, written for curious humans and
        organized as a clean expandable FAQ.
      </p>
    </header>

