            <p>
              Most cats sleep 12 to 16 hours a day, with kittens and senior cats
              often needing even more rest.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="example">
          <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="cat-faq-3" id="cat-faq-btn-3">
            Why do cats knead blankets?
          </button>
