            <p>
              Kneading is a comforting behavior that often traces back to kittenhood
              and can signal contentment or a cozy routine.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="example">
          <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="cat-faq-4" id="cat-faq-btn-4">
            Do cats need baths?
          </button>
          <div class="details" id="cat-faq-4" role="region" aria-labelledby="cat-faq-btn-4" hidden>
            <p>
              Usually not. Healthy cats groom themselves well, but occasional baths
              can help if a vet recommends one or if a cat gets into something messy.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="example">
          <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="cat-faq-5" id="cat-faq-btn-5">
            How can I make my cat happier?
          </button>
          <div class="details" id="cat-faq-5" role="region" aria-labelledby="cat-faq-btn-5" hidden>
            <p>
              Offer predictable routines, scratching posts, play sessions, fresh
              water, and quiet places to rest.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      Built as a simple expandable FAQ with native buttons and keyboard support.
    </footer>

    <script>
